Package: pixiewps-extend
Version: 1.4.4-1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @anbuinfosec <anbuinfosec@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/anbuinfosec/pixiewps-extend
Depends: libc++
Description: WPS pixie-dust attack tool with worldwide router database
 pixiewps is a tool dedicated to brute force attack against Wifi Protected
 Setup (WPS) registrar PIN. It is meant to be launched against WiFi routers,
 it implements a last resume mechanism.
 .
 This enhanced v1.4.4 version includes:
 - Worldwide router database (65+ models)
 - Regional optimization for South/Southeast Asia, East Asia, North America, Europe
 - Auto-detection with confidence scoring
 - Retry mechanism with backoff
 - Support for 20+ router modes
 - Statistics and performance tracking
